        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Purchased. Registered File number 1992/826.\nWithout seeing the reverse it is not possible to be absolutely certain which stitches are used. It seems to be satin stitch and variations of satin stitch, but may be double darned instead. The drawing was done with ink, the silk was embroidered first and then the metal threads."@en .

